\begin_layout Subsubsection
Linux
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Download and extract the installation file from Bio7 Github Releases.
 Bio7 comes bundled with Java (Adoptium).
 Please note that you have to start Bio7 with Xorg (X display server) because of SWT_AWT which is used by ImageJ.
 For Linux you have to install R and a special compiled version of Rserve.
 The default OS path to R is used automatically if not set (like in Windows) in the preferences.
 Simply execute an available Groovy script in the R-Shell view (see Windows notes above).
 
