 To install the Bio7 examples please import the examples from the Examples.zip file.

\series bold
 
\noun on
File
\noun default
\SpecialChar menuseparator

\noun on
Import
\noun default
\SpecialChar menuseparator

\noun on
Existing Projects into Workspace
\series default
